    "en": {
      "trackName": "Dungeon Crawler RPG Watch",
      "description": "Step off the beaten path — your epic quest begins now.\n\nDungeon Crawler RPG is a true old-school dungeon crawler, rebuilt with depth, strategy, and survival at its core. No shortcuts. No gimmicks. Just thoughtful exploration and tactical combat in a rich fantasy world.\n\nYou play as Oro, a renegade wizard on a desperate mission to stop The Death and its necromantic horde before a world-ending ritual is completed. Every step matters. Every encounter demands strategy. Every decision can mean life or death.\n\n* Turn-based battles with real tactical depth \n* A large hand-crafted world explored tile by tile \n* Elemental spells and evolving abilities \n* Villages, dungeons, guardians, and powerful bosses \n* Designed for immersive, focused play sessions\n\nCreated for players who crave challenge, strategy, and classic RPG depth, Dungeon Crawler RPG delivers a complete fantasy adventure in a compact, accessible format.",
